CarelessChess NNUE — third-party network provenance
====================================================

The embedded default network `net.bin` and the inference scheme in
`nnue.{h,cpp}` are a port of the NNUE from the akimbo chess engine by
Jamie Whiting (https://github.com/jw1912/akimbo), used under the MIT
License (see LICENSE-akimbo). The network was trained by the akimbo
author with the `bullet` trainer; CarelessChess does not train it.

Architecture: (768 -> 1024)x2 -> 1, 4 king-input buckets with horizontal
mirroring, SCReLU activation, QA=255 QB=64 SCALE=400, plus akimbo's
material output scaling.

No modification was made to the network weights; only the inference was
re-implemented in C++ for this engine.
